OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBlustery showers will spread
OL,6,Fsouthwards through the day with these
OL,7,Fmost frequent in the north and over
OL,8,Fthe Western Isles. Further south and
OL,9,Feast showers more isolated with longer
OL,10,Fbright spells. Showers may be wintry.
OL,11,FStrong winds around the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers will continue to
OL,14,Fspread south and east overnight,
OL,15,Fwintry over high ground. The south
OL,16,Fseeing the best of any drier and
OL,17,Fclearer spells. Strong winds easing
OL,18,Fand turning westerly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
