OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy day with some
OL,6,Fbright intervals. Showers spreading
OL,7,Feast, these wintry over high ground at
OL,8,Ffirst. Best of any drier spells in the
OL,9,Feast. Wind strengthening later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fover the weekend with showers or
OL,13,Fperhaps longer spells of rain
OL,14,Fspreading north and east. Perhaps
OL,15,Fturning drier on Monday with some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells. Strong winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
